  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">provision of humanitarian assistance to IDPs, including LGBT+ people</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected results: it is planned to provide 250 IDPs and 50 LGBT+ People with: 300 food kits, 300 hygiene kits and psycho-social support to 200 persons. Activities include among other: 1.To continue the work of our organization, we need constant access to electricity. For this a Portable charge station is needed as well as a laptop with a battery that can last more than 5 hours without recharging. 2. a psychologist will provide counselling offline and online. For IDPs and LGBTIQ+ people, who turn to us for help, it is necessary to organize the opportunity to receive individual consultations of a psychologist and a social worker.3.Purchase of food kits for most needy IDPs and LGBT+ People. 4.Purchase of hygiene kits for most needy IDPs and LGBT+ People. 5.Packing and distribution of kits.</narrative>
  </description>
